WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.644 --> 00:00:08.980
<b>Can you help me knock out some of my to-dos?</b>

2
00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:10.690
<b>And can you put on some music?</b>

3
00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.984
<b>You can already talk to ChatGPT using Voice.</b>

4
00:00:12.984 --> 00:00:14.610
<b>But when you use it in ChatGPT Work</b>

5
00:00:14.610 --> 00:00:16.571
<b>on your computer, it can actually start tasks</b>

6
00:00:16.571 --> 00:00:17.572
<b>and get things done.</b>

7
00:00:17.572 --> 00:00:19.032
<b>I start Voice from the Work tab</b>

8
00:00:19.032 --> 00:00:20.450
<b>in the ChatGPT desktop app.</b>

9
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:23.202
<b>I can use the Voice button or a keyboard shortcut.</b>

10
00:00:23.202 --> 00:00:25.163
<b>I need your help working through a few things.</b>

11
00:00:25.163 --> 00:00:27.498
<b>Let's start with the Dev Day activation ideas.</b>

12
00:00:27.498 --> 00:00:28.541
<b>I've got a couple of ideas,</b>

13
00:00:28.541 --> 00:00:30.335
<b>and I'm hoping we can brainstorm together.</b>

14
00:00:30.335 --> 00:00:32.795
<b>One idea is controlling Codex from a Game Boy.</b>

15
00:00:32.795 --> 00:00:35.089
<b>Another is a booth where people use ChatGPT</b>

16
00:00:35.089 --> 00:00:37.091
<b>and image generation to design a custom T-shirt</b>

17
00:00:37.091 --> 00:00:38.259
<b>and get it printed right there.</b>

18
00:00:38.259 --> 00:00:40.136
<b>What do you think? Any other ideas?</b>

19
00:00:41.429 --> 00:00:43.014
<b>Those are all strong.</b>

20
00:00:43.014 --> 00:00:45.183
<b>Game Boy Hack is surprising.</b>

21
00:00:45.183 --> 00:00:48.353
<b>The shirt booth is personal and the collaborative game</b>

22
00:00:48.353 --> 00:00:50.271
<b>gives a shared artifact.</b>

23
00:00:50.271 --> 00:00:52.899
<b>For that one, imagine a big screen showing </b>

24
00:00:52.899 --> 00:00:55.360
<b>a simple game that evolves all day.</b>

25
00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.946
<b>Each person uses Codex to add a character level sound,</b>

26
00:00:58.946 --> 00:01:02.075
<b> whatever, and it becomes this community built theme</b>

27
00:01:02.075 --> 00:01:05.828
<b>or a living digital mural that gets built piece by piece.</b>

28
00:01:06.371 --> 00:01:07.914
<b>I think it sounds really interesting.</b>

29
00:01:07.914 --> 00:01:09.749
<b>Could you start working on a visual pitch deck?</b>

30
00:01:09.749 --> 00:01:12.251
<b>Use the OpenAI Slides template and image generation</b>

31
00:01:12.251 --> 00:01:13.961
<b>to show what these concepts could look like.</b>

32
00:01:13.961 --> 00:01:15.046
<b>Keep working on it in the background</b>

33
00:01:15.046 --> 00:01:16.089
<b>while we move on.</b>

34
00:01:16.839 --> 00:01:19.050
<b>On it, let me take a first pass.</b>

35
00:01:19.050 --> 00:01:20.843
<b>Here, ChatGPT can start the task</b>

36
00:01:20.843 --> 00:01:22.303
<b>and use my connected tools,</b>

37
00:01:22.303 --> 00:01:23.638
<b>and I can keep using my computer.</b>

38
00:01:23.971 --> 00:01:25.807
<b>The Dev Day deck is ready.</b>

39
00:01:25.807 --> 00:01:28.017
<b> with seven image led slides</b>

40
00:01:28.017 --> 00:01:30.019
<b>shared game, custom shirt booth, </b>

41
00:01:30.019 --> 00:01:32.063
<b>Codex Game Boy, living mural, build relay,</b>

42
00:01:32.063 --> 00:01:33.064
<b>and a few more.</b>

43
00:01:33.064 --> 00:01:34.440
<b>Want me to pull it up?</b>

44
00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.691
<b>Yeah, pull it up.</b>

45
00:01:35.691 --> 00:01:38.069
<b>This version of Voice runs in the desktop app.</b>

46
00:01:38.069 --> 00:01:39.195
<b>To use it from my phone,</b>

47
00:01:39.195 --> 00:01:41.030
<b>I connect my phone via Remote,</b>

48
00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:43.199
<b>and then tap the button to trigger Voice.</b>

49
00:01:43.199 --> 00:01:45.451
<b>Can you show me the latest version of the presentation?</b>

50
00:01:45.451 --> 00:01:47.829
<b>Now I have a pitch deck, ready to go,</b>

51
00:01:47.829 --> 00:01:49.122
<b>just by talking it through.</b>

52
00:01:49.122 --> 00:01:50.847
<b>That's ChatGPT Work.</b>
